T*
(```mermaid) Tj
T*
(flowchart LR) Tj
T*
(  Motion[Motion Sensor] --> SensorManager) Tj
T*
(  SensorManager --> ROM[ROM Normalization]) Tj
T*
(  ROM --> RepDetector) Tj
T*
(  RepDetector --> SessionRecorder) Tj
T*
(  RFID[RFID Reader] --> UserSync[User Sync]) Tj
T*
(  UserSync --> Recommendation) Tj
T*
(  Recommendation --> UI[LVGL UI]) Tj
T*
(  SessionRecorder --> UploadQueue[NVS Upload Queue]) Tj
T*
(  UploadQueue --> Firebase[Firebase RTDB]) Tj
T*
(  Firebase --> Dashboard[React Dashboard]) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The system is split into embedded firmware, Firebase RTDB, and dashboard) Tj
T*
(visualization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Sensor is sampled every 5 ms.) Tj
T*
(2. SensorManager filters the analog value.) Tj
T*
(3. Firmware converts sensor reading to ROM percentage.) Tj
T*
(4. User calibration maps raw ROM into user-normalized ROM.) Tj
T*
(5. RepDetector identifies rep phases and completed reps.) Tj
T*
(6. SessionRecorder stores reps, sets, weight, ROM, timing, and quality.) Tj
T*
(7. SmartGymTouchApp computes summary/recommendation updates.) Tj
T*
(8. Upload queue stores Firebase payloads.) Tj
T*
(9. FirebaseService sends memory-safe writes to RTDB.) Tj
T*
(10. Dashboard reads Firebase for charts and summaries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(User Login Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
