T*
(Manual Pin Load vs Recommendation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pin load is physical machine state. It stays with the machine across users.) Tj
T*
(Recommendation is user-specific advice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The firmware never changes pin load because of recommendation. The user physically) Tj
T*
(changes the machine pin and updates the UI with weight buttons.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration uses the current machine pin load and suggested loads. The user confirms) Tj
T*
(the physical load before collecting reps. The firmware analyzes smooth reps, estimates) Tj
T*
(load suitability, and saves user-machine calibration data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
