(Sampling and Refresh Rates) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Main app tick: 4 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Sensor sample interval: 5 ms, approximately 200 Hz.) Tj
T*
(- Graph refresh: 16 ms, approximately 60 Hz.) Tj
T*
(- Slow UI refresh: 140 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Debug UI refresh: 160 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Normal cloud service cadence: 5000 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Summary/cloud finish cadence: approximately 1200 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Device heartbeat interval: 60000 ms.) Tj
T*
(- User sync timeout: 12000 ms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Memory Strategy) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The ESP32 is memory-constrained during TLS/Firebase writes. The firmware tracks) Tj
T*
(internal heap and largest internal block, then selects upload behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Normal: larger payloads.) Tj
T*
(- Constrained: smaller payloads and chunked repSets.) Tj
T*
(- Critical: very small payloads or backoff.) Tj
